	(text "THE CONTROL REGISTER FROM THE ATTRIBUTE BYTE, THE THREE GUNS, THE SYNCS, THE VGA SOCKET" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e5fef26f-fc8d-5653-8266-49fa73300c30"))
	(text "IC34 takes MAD0-7 as dot 7 begins in every cycle (P56's end); IC35 copies it when HSYNC rises, the one moment\nit holds the chip's attribute byte (ATR). Bits 0-2: red, green, blue off; 3, 4: HSYNC, VSYNC positive; 5: text\non; 6: XOR; 7: the second font. Each gun = the dot AND NOT its off bit, through 470 ohm into the monitor's 75." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "86aa7ab3-f8eb-50b5-99ef-92c10be7e221"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
